  DTS:Description="Central failure handler. Child packages call this after an unhandled error so that the error is written once to etl.ErrorLog, the open batch step and the package execution row are closed as failed, and the failure is classified as transient or permanent from the error code. Transient failures are marked retryable so ERR_Retry_FailedSteps can pick them up; permanent ones fail the batch."
